    "nullRestrictionRule": "A restriction field that no pinned read gives is null. A row with any null restriction field is DENIED, UNKNOWN or a review row with no decision: its release outcome is DENY_RELEASE, its distributionMode is NONE, and it is never served (fail closed).",
